00:02:18.950 --> 00:02:20.060
What is Segment?

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.780
How does it work?

00:02:21.780 --> 00:02:25.170
Then we'll transition to the
architecture of Persona itself,

00:02:25.170 --> 00:02:26.760
how it's built,
